# Backend
**/*.pyc
**/.env

# Local SQLite database — must NOT ship in the image. The DB is created fresh
# (init_db) or restored from blob by Litestream at container start, and
# `litestream restore` refuses to run if the file already exists.
**/data/*.db
**/data/*.db-wal
**/data/*.db-shm

## Will be built by multistage docker build
**/static

# Frontend
**/node_modules
